# Code owners for the Agent Skills catalog.
#
# Ownership is deliberately per-skill: the catalog maintainer owns the catalog
# contract (tooling, CI, the fgdh.* metadata registry, releases) and each skill
# owner owns the correctness of one skill's content. Without the per-skill lines
# below the core team becomes a review bottleneck on every domain change.
#
# Every handle listed here must resolve to an existing GitHub user or team.
# `scripts/check_owners.py` verifies this weekly against the owners recorded in
# skills/index.json; an unresolved owner is a retirement trigger, see
# docs/lifecycle.md.
#
# The last matching pattern wins, so the global fallback comes first.

# Global fallback: the catalog maintainer.
